Custom CSS (9–18)

9. display:none removes from layout; visibility:hidden keeps space.


10. Content → padding → border → margin; devs forget padding adds size.


11. Inline > ID > class > element.


12. relative = offset self; absolute = nearest positioned parent; fixed = viewport; sticky = scroll-based.


13. rem = scalable; em = relative nesting; px = fixed.


14. Works only on positioned elements and within stacking context.


15. A new layering context created by position, transform, opacity, etc.


16. Grow = expand, shrink = compress, basis = base size.


17. inline-block = inline layout; flex = layout system.


18. Poor breakpoints, mobile-last approach.




